o be processed and disbursed as the first next week and NSSF payment\"}],\"budget_statuses\":[],\"target_accomplished_status\":\"partially_completed\"}', NULL, 0, 'Here is the updated reason:\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThe tasks were not completed this week due to the high volume of concurrent activities handled during the week,Bunda Workshop retirement documentation, and other routine financial operations, which collectively consumed the available working time and capacity of the finance team.', 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-25 16:09:11', '2026-05-11 15:54:26', NULL),
('01kq20van8bgjvb9a4dd16bwpa', '01kpb51c9pcr257b9cwpmjj1qg', '01kp6ghr857fv2d5gc4yb99tmq', 'weekly_report', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Weekly Report - Week 17', NULL, NULL, '{\"summary\":\"This week focused on strengthening STEM club implementation through school engagement, development of learning materials, media outreach, and stakeholder follow-up.\\r\\n\\r\\nA key activity was a visit to Mkolani Secondary School, where a meeting was held with the new Head of School. During the meeting, the STEM program was introduced, including ongoing STEM clubs and the importance of integrating tablet devices into learning. The Head of School acknowledged the program and confirmed that Form Two and Form Four students are currently sitting for examinations up to next Wednesday. However, arrangements were made for Form One and Form Three students to begin using tablets on Tuesday. After completion of examinations, Form Two and Form Four students will also join STEM club sessions for tablet-based learning.\\r\\n\\r\\nIn terms of content development, Physics guide notes focusing on Current Electricity and Static Electricity were prepared and shared with STEM clubs to support weekly learning sessions.\\r\\n\\r\\nFor media outreach, efforts were made to engage Crown Media for promotion of the STEM Innovation Competition; however, the team was not reachable via phone, and further follow-up is ongoing.\\r\\n\\r\\nOn stakeholder engagement, reminder emails were sent to COSTECH regarding competition endorsement, but no response has been received yet. The same situation applies to the STEM Learning Organization, where follow-ups are still ongoing without feedback.\",\"activity_progress\":[{\"activity_output\":\"Monday - Visit Mkolani Secondary School and orient new teacher on tablet device usage\",\"off_plan_activity\":\"\",\"progress\":\"Done\",\"remarks_challenges\":\"School timetable affected the participation\",\"next_step\":\"Follow-up after exams\",\"carry_to_next_plan\":false},{\"activity_output\":\"Monday - Facilitate STEM Club Session\",\"off_plan_activity\":\"\",\"progress\":\"Done\",\"remarks_challenges\":\"Out of 38 STEM club sessions conducted, 8 schools faced challenges where club patrons and matrons were unable to access learning content on the system due to internet connectivity limitations\",\"next_step\":\"Provide online and offline learning materials\",\"carry_to_next_plan\":false},{\"activity_output\":\"Wednesday - Prepare Biology, Chemistry, and Mathematics Guide Notes\",\"off_plan_activity\":\"\",\"progress\":\"Not started\",\"remarks_challenges\":\"Time constraints affected completion\",\"next_step\":\"Prepare on next week\",\"carry_to_next_plan\":true},{\"activity_output\":\"Tuesday - Conduct media tour with RFA to advertise STEM Competition\",\"off_plan_activity\":\"\",\"progress\":\"In progress\",\"remarks_challenges\":\"Unable to reach via phone\",\"next_step\":\"Continue follow-up\",\"carry_to_next_plan\":false},{\"activity_output\":\"Thursday - Follow up with COSTECH for STEM Competition endorsement\",\"off_plan_activity\":\"\",\"progress\":\"In progress\",\"remarks_challenges\":\"No response received yet\",\"next_step\":\"Continue reminders\",\"carry_to_next_plan\":false},{\"activity_output\":\"Friday - Conduct media tour with  Star TV to advertise STEM Competition\",\"off_plan_activity\":\"\",\"progress\":\"Not started\",\"remarks_challenges\":\"RFA not suitable for visibilit\",\"next_step\":\"Follow up with Crown Media\",\"carry_to_next_plan\":true},{\"activity_output\":\"Monday - Prepare Physics Guide Notes and share with STEM Clubs\",\"off_plan_activity\":\"\",\"progress\":\"Done\",\"remarks_challenges\":\"Shared with STEM clubs\",\"next_step\":\"Continue other subjects\",\"carry_to_next_plan\":false},{\"activity_output\":\"Thursday - Follow-up meeting with STEM Learning Organization\",\"off_plan_activity\":\"\",\"progress\":\"Done\",\"remarks_challenges\":\"No response yet\",\"next_step\":\"Follow-up communication\",\"carry_to_next_plan\":false},{\"activity_output\":\"Saturday - Conduct sartuday lab session\",\"off_plan_activity\":\"\",\"progress\":\"Done\",\"remarks_challenges\":\"Students assembled M-Bot car and LEGO SPIKE\",\"next_step\":\"Continue  robotics sessions\",\"carry_to_next_plan\":false}],\"key_achievements\":[\"Teachers successfully registered students in the STEMLabs system\",\"one school has successfully completed registration in the STEM Innovation Competition\",\"Conducted STEM clubs sessions\"],\"challenges_mitigation\":[{\"challenge\":\"No response from COSTECH\",\"action_taken_planned\":\"Sent reminders and ongoing follow-up\"},{\"challenge\":\"No response from STEM Learning Organization\",\"action_taken_planned\":\"Sent reminders and ongoing follow-up\"},{\"challenge\":\"Crown Media unreachable\",\"action_taken_planned\":\"Continued follow-up and alternative contact attempts\"}],\"budget_statuses\":[],\"target_accomplished_status\":\"partially_completed\"}', NULL, 0, 'The target was not fully achieved due to academic calendar interruptions, delayed stakeholder responses, and media engagement constraints', 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-25 16:52:03', '2026-05-11 15:54:26', NULL),
