('01kq265w1jc35xakwqsk8576ww', '01kpb4njr44rav03q99e0nzyx1', '01kp6ghr857fv2d5gc4yb99tmq', 'weekly_report', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Weekly Report - Week 17', NULL, NULL, '{\"summary\":\"During the week, I worked on uploading projects and contributing to session content for the Adilisha STEM Labs platform. I also designed and developed an interview system as part of a system update and facilitated candidate interviews. While progress was made on the main objective, some tasks remained incomplete due to the additional responsibilities assigned.\",\"activity_progress\":[{\"activity_output\":\"Monday - Plan content upload structure with Programs team\",\"off_plan_activity\":\"\",\"progress\":\"Done\",\"remarks_challenges\":\"Need a clear roadmap of the contents to be uploaded every weekly for STEM Clubs sessions\",\"next_step\":null,\"carry_to_next_plan\":false},{\"activity_output\":\"Tuesday - Upload 40 experiments to the platform\",\"off_plan_activity\":\"\",\"progress\":\"Not started\",\"remarks_challenges\":null,\"next_step\":null,\"carry_to_next_plan\":true},{\"activity_output\":\"Wednesday - Continue facilitations of experiments uploads\",\"off_plan_activity\":\"\",\"progress\":\"Not started\",\"remarks_challenges\":\"Time was limited, so we didn\\u2019t get a chance to meet on Wednesday with the rest of the team since i was assigned another task\",\"next_step\":null,\"carry_to_next_plan\":true},{\"activity_output\":\"Thursday - Upload 10 projects to the platform\",\"off_plan_activity\":\"\",\"progress\":\"Partially done\",\"remarks_challenges\":\"I only updated three projects: the solar tracker Arduino system and the smart irrigation system using a capacitive soil moisture sensor.\",\"next_step\":\"Upload the rest 7 projects to the week 18\",\"carry_to_next_plan\":true},{\"activity_output\":\"Friday - Evaluation and Improvement of competition panel side of the Adilisha STEM labs to address challenges that might happen\",\"off_plan_activity\":\"\",\"progress\":\"Not started\",\"remarks_challenges\":\"Time was limited, as I was focused on creating the interview panel for the Adilisha website.\",\"next_step\":\"The task will be done on the next week of work period\",\"carry_to_next_plan\":true},{\"activity_output\":\"__off_plan__\",\"off_plan_activity\":\"Interview panel creation\",\"progress\":\"Done\",\"remarks_challenges\":\"On Wednesday and Thursday, I was assigned the task of creating an interview system as part of a system update, and on Friday, I facilitated interviews for the candidates.\",\"next_step\":null,\"carry_to_next_plan\":false}],\"key_achievements\":[\"Designed and developed the new Interview Panel System\\r\\n-Successfully created an interview system\\/panel as part of the organization\\u2019s digital systems improvement, enabling smoother management of candidate interviews.\",\"Contributed to STEM platform content strengthening initiatives\\r\\n-Worked on preparation and facilitation of experiment and session content uploads to support the long-term enrichment of the Adilisha STEM Labs learning platform.\",\"Contributed to organization profile preparation\\r\\n-Provided additional technical support beyond the weekly plan by assisting in the organization profile preparation\"],\"challenges_mitigation\":[{\"challenge\":\"Limited Team Coordination Time for Content Upload Sessions due to time and task interference\",\"action_taken_planned\":\"A follow-up coordination schedule will be done next work period\"}],\"budget_statuses\":[],\"target_accomplished_status\":\"partially_completed\"}', NULL, 0, 'I was unable to fully complete the objective because I was assigned additional responsibilities, including developing the interview system and preparing the organization profile, which required significant time and focus.', 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-04-25 18:25:11', '2026-05-11 15:54:26', NULL),
