ay - Meeting with Dr. Nibu\",\"off_plan_activity\":\"\",\"progress\":\"Done\",\"remarks_challenges\":\"Meeting was postponed to saturday but it was successfully conducted\",\"next_step\":\"Onboard animation team\",\"carry_to_next_plan\":false},{\"activity_output\":\"Tuesday - Review storytelling simulation script and Prepare Dr. Nibu coordination agenda\",\"off_plan_activity\":\"\",\"progress\":\"Done\",\"remarks_challenges\":\"Review went well. We even designed the script document in two parts and shared with Dr. Nibu\",\"next_step\":\"Creation of animated videos to measure engagements before we dedicate resources\",\"carry_to_next_plan\":false}],\"key_meetings\":[{\"meeting_uid\":\"01KQS257SSCTQ2QBPX8SA3WCTC\",\"location\":\"Virtual\",\"reactions_notes\":\"Implementation start meeting\",\"date\":\"2026-05-06\",\"meeting\":\"Dr. Nibu Virtual STEM labs meeting\",\"participant_user_ids\":[\"01kpdrfj9wgpzb4ymkaegpq198\",\"01kpb4njr44rav03q99e0nzyx1\",\"01kp8mdgyvgt8xwzmedfcyvmyw\"],\"status\":\"\"}],\"key_achievements\":[\"Meeting with Dr. Nibu now allowed us to ,move from writings to technical part of execution\",\"The new programs manager is aware of the program units and organisation objectives. Onboarding is now at 50%\",\"Creation of Vacancy post for Strategic relationships officer marks the actual expansion of Adilisha visibility initiative\"],\"challenges_mitigation\":[{\"challenge\":\"Transition of STEM clubs coordinator presented a layer of gap in initial onboarding\",\"action_taken_planned\":\"In support with F.O impromptu meetings were conducted and assistances were offered to support his new roles\"}],\"budget_statuses\":[],\"target_accomplished_status\":\"completed\"}', NULL, 1, NULL, 'draft', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-09 18:51:12', '2026-05-11 15:54:26', NULL),
